  "question": {
    "text": "A rod of mass M and length L is hinged at its one end and carries a block of mass m at its lower end. A spring of force constant k<sub>1</sub> is installed at distance a from the hinge and another of force constant k<sub>2</sub> at a distance b as shown in the figure. If the whole arrangement rests on a smooth horizontal table top, find the frequency of vibration.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/fdhgdfhdghdofil.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 182px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
